==Restrictions==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Max # of Deployable Cats: 15

==='''Chapter 2 & 3'''===
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
===<u>Chapter 1</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Zoge|Zir Zeal|Doge Dark|Zang Roo|Shadow Boxer K}}
*8 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Zir Zeal]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Zang Roo]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

===<u>Chapter 2</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Doge Dark|Zollow|Shadow Boxer K|Celeboodle|Li'l Zyclone|Ragin' Gory}}
*6 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 9.33 seconds<sup>280f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Zollow]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**7 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Li'l Zyclone]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**1 [[Ragin' Gory]] spawns after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>.
**1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 14.67 seconds<sup>440f</sup>.

===<u>Chapter 3</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Zroco|Wild Doge|Shadow Boxer K|Kid Tappa|Scissoroo|Zang Roo}}
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Kid Tappa]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Zang Roo]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
A typical Black/Zombie stage, shouldn't be too difficult even without [[Treasure|Treasures]] due to the absence of Starred Aliens. Bring some anti-Dark such as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], and some anti-Zombie like [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] and [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver Bear Cat]].

